    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_time_region" kindref="compound">TimeRegion</ref> class is used as a helper class to call the startTimer() and stopTimer() methods of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_timer" kindref="compound">Timer</ref> class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When the object is constructed, it starts the timer specified as its argument. When it is destroyed, it stops the relevant timer. This makes it easy to time a region of code. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
